# NULLXES live events (JSONL). Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Append one event per line, then re-run with the SAME seed.
# Mapping headline → category is an ASSUMPTION lexicon, not a trained classifier.
#
# Modes:
#   observed  — already happened: force that category event on that day (all worlds)
#   risk_up   — raise intensity from that day through the horizon
#   config    — only apply dotted config overrides
#
# {"ts":"2026-09-29","category":"GEO","mode":"observed","text":"payment compliance delay","p_boost":0.1,"loss_rub":0}
# 2026-10-03 FIN банк запросил доп.документы, delay
#
# Free-text also works:
# 2026-09-30 GEO санкционный комплаенс остановил платёж
